<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Emma & David - Invitation de Mariage</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts for Elegant Typography -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600&family=Great+Vibes&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --burgundy: #6B1D2F;
            --deep-burgundy: #4A101D;
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --rose-muted: #B3888F;
            --cream: #FDFBF7;
            --text-dark: #333333;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a060a;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        /* Mobile Container Simulation */
        .phone-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 412px;
            height: 844px;
            background-color: var(--cream);
            border-radius: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            overflow-y: auto;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            position: relative;
            border: 8px solid #222;
        }

        /* Hide scrollbar for Chrome, Safari and Opera */
        .phone-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }

        /* Custom Section Divider */
        .divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px auto;
            width: 60%;
        }
        .divider::before, .divider::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--gold);
        }
        .divider-flower {
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 0 10px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        /* SECTION 1: HERO SCREEN */
        .hero-section {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(74, 16, 29, 0.45), rgba(42, 6, 13, 0.9)), url('red.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px 20px;
            color: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .we-do-container {
            margin-top: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .we-do-text {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            font-size: 65px;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .hero-names {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-invitation-text {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            max-width: 80%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0.9;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .date-badge {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
            padding: 10px 0;
            margin-top: auto;
            width: 85%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .date-main {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .scroll-btn {
            margin-top: 25px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }

        /* SECTION 2: DETAILS SCREEN */
        .details-section {
            padding: 50px 30px;
            background-color: var(--cream);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            font-size: 45px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .detail-block {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .detail-subtitle {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .detail-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Color Palette Display */
        .color-palette {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .color-circle {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        /* SECTION 3: RSVP SCREEN */
        .rsvp-section {
            padding: 50px 30px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0eae1;
        }

        .rsvp-deadline {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .rsvp-form {
            text-align: left;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            background-color: var(--cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--burgundy);
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: var(--burgundy);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--deep-burgundy);
        }

        .thank-you-text {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            font-size: 40px;
            color: var(--burgundy);
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* Animations */
        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            40% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
            60% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Phone Wrapper Simulation -->
    <div class="phone-container">
        
        <!-- SECTION 1: HERO SCREEN -->
        <section class="hero-section" id="hero">
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Accompagnés de leurs familles</p>
            
            <div class="we-do-container">
                <h1 class="we-do-text">Nous faisons</h1>
                <h1 class="we-do-text">le grand saut</h1>
                <h2 class="hero-names">Emma & David</h2>
                <p class="hero-invitation-text">Vous invitent à les suivre dans la célébration de leur amour</p>
            </div>

            <div class="date-badge">
                <div>SAMEDI</div>
                <div class="date-main">25</div>
                <div>
                    <div>NOV</div>
                    <div>À 19H00</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button class="scroll-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('details').scrollIntoView();">&#x2193;</button>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 2: DETAILS SCREEN -->
        <section class="details-section" id="details">
            <h2 class="section-title">Détails</h2>
            <div class="divider"><span class="divider-flower">&#10047;</span></div>
            
            <!-- Code Vestimentaire -->
            <div class="detail-block">
                <h3 class="detail-subtitle">Code Vestimentaire</h3>
                <p class="detail-text">
                    Semi-formal et élégant. Les tissus légers ainsi que les couleurs douces et estivales sont chaleureusement bienvenus.
                </p>
                <div class="color-palette">
                    <div class="color-circle" style="background-color: #6B1D2F;"></div>
                    <div class="color-circle" style="background-color: #B3888F;"></div>
                    <div class="color-circle" style="background-color: #D4AF37;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Transport -->
            <div class="detail-block">
                <h3 class="detail-subtitle">Transport</h3>
                <p class="detail-text">
                    Des navettes seront disponibles pour transporter les invités de la cérémonie jusqu'au lieu de la réception. Les départs se feront immédiatement après la cérémonie.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Hébergement -->
            <div class="detail-block">
                <h3 class="detail-subtitle">Hébergement</h3>
                <p class="detail-text">
                    Pour ceux qui viennent de loin et souhaitent passer la nuit sur place, un hôtel Marriott est situé à seulement 5 minutes en voiture du lieu de la réception.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <button class="submit-btn" style="width: auto; padding: 10px 25px;" onclick="document.getElementById('rsvp').scrollIntoView();">Confirmer Présence</button>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 3: RSVP SCREEN -->
        <section class="rsvp-section" id="rsvp">
            <h2 class="section-title">R.S.V.P</h2>
            <p class="rsvp-deadline">AVANT LE 15 AOÛT</p>
            <div class="divider"><span class="divider-flower">&#10047;</span></div>
            
            <p class="detail-text" style="font-style: italic;">
                Veuillez s'il vous plaît remplir le formulaire ci-dessous pour nous confirmer votre présence.
            </p>

            <form class="rsvp-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Merci pour votre réponse !');">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="name">Nom Complet</label>
                    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Ex: Jean Dupont" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="attendance">Serez-vous présent ?</label>
                    <select id="attendance" required>
                        <option value="">Sélectionnez une option</option>
                        <option value="yes">Oui, j'ai hâte de fêter ça avec vous !</option>
                        <option value="no">Malheureusement, je ne pourrai pas être présent</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="guests">Nombre d'accompagnateurs</label>
                    <select id="guests">
                        <option value="0">Seul(e)</option>
                        <option value="1">+1 Accompagnateur</option>
                        <option value="2">+2 Accompagnateurs</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Envoyer la réponse</button>
            </form>

            <h3 class="thank-you-text">Merci !</h3>
        </section>

    </div>

</body>
</html>